  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 1056628535}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1078312131}
  zoneMap: {fileID: 1703158453}
  promptHeight: 2.1
  lines:
  - You're awake... good. Not many come out of cryo anymore.
  - The Main Hub is sealed. I've patched my access into its doors - they'll open for you now.
  - Take this map of Zone 1. Press M to look at it.
  - And stay out of the dark corners.
  repeatLine: The Hub is open. Check your map with M. Go.
  parasiteLine: Check your parasite meter. That's all the time you've got. Don't let it hit zero - that's how they get you.
